---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import Button from '../Button.astro';
---

<Section variant="white" id="current-wedges" label="Solutions Available Today">
  <h2 class="text-h2 mb-md max-w-3xl">Two solutions. One operating goal.</h2>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-lg">
    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-text/10 bg-texture-1 p-lg">
      <h3 class="text-h3 mb-xs">Backroom Automation</h3>
      <p class="text-body text-muted mb-sm">
        Operational work accumulates quietly. People copy data between systems,
        reconcile records, prepare reports, chase approvals, process documents,
        and manually handle recurring exceptions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand my-sm">
        Manual work in spreadsheets, approvals, and reports &rarr; moves into
        reliable systems that run on their own.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-muted">
        Guava identifies high-value workflows and moves the appropriate burden
        into reliable systems.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-lg">
        <Button variant="outline" href="/solutions/backroom-automation">Explore Backroom Automation</Button>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-text/10 bg-texture-1 p-lg">
      <h3 class="text-h3 mb-xs">Guava BI</h3>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-sm">
        Decision Intelligence
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-muted mb-sm">
        Inventory businesses generate large amounts of operational data. The
        harder problem is determining what deserves attention and what to do
        next.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand my-sm">
        Scattered, stale inventory data &rarr; trusted visibility, important
        signals, actionable recommendations.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body text-muted">
        Built for inventory-driven businesses where small operational signals
        can materially affect margin, availability, and working capital.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-lg">
        <Button variant="outline" href="/solutions/inventory-intelligence">Explore Guava BI</Button>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Section>